  - "jack-sensing"
  - "real-time-audio"
license: "MIT"
abstract: "Qearon is a high-performance, deterministic Linux audio diagnostic and repair system engineered in pure Zig. It bridges kernel-level ALSA register sensing with modern PipeWire node graphs to resolve hardware-level analog bleed, impedance mismatching, and jack sensing failures without third-party runtime dependencies."
